  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4629fea0f608ea15",
      "translationZh": "在我的语境中，智能水平是一个综合指数，我将其称为 Agentic Coding Index，它涵盖了最相关的智能体编程基准测试：SWE-bench Pro、DeepSWE v1.1、Terminal-Bench（v4、v3、v2.1）、Code Arena Elo 和 LiveCodeBench v6。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cbe39602a515edc",
      "translationZh": "Norm：设定一个中性基准值（= 50）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c670a441185409bd",
      "translationZh": "Super_Linear_Exponent：采用非线性缩放，以避免奖励极小的模型（否则，几乎不会写代码的小模型会人为地占据排行榜前列），同时奖励真正的自主精通能力。Scale = 2.5354。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b3b6c2c1c72c4b8",
      "translationZh": "PCount：模型参数数量（以十亿为单位）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "415e95b0f2be524e",
      "translationZh": "PLowerBound：模型参数数量的下限（正则化项，用于避免参数量 <1B 的模型得分飙升），=8B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "577186503ec841aa",
      "translationZh": "Agentic Coding Index：DeepSWE v1.1（20%）、Code Arena Elo（20%）、Terminal-Bench v4.0（15%）、SWE-bench Pro（15%）、Terminal-Bench v3.0（13%）、Terminal-Bench v2.1（12%）和 LiveCodeBench v6（5%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2ad5d81f9ab6520",
      "translationZh": "数据完整性：所有基准测试分数均从经过核实的公开及官方来源（模型创建者、经过同行评审的评估报告）中筛选整理而来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
